@Taskflow_api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5023

### Get all tasks
GET {{Taskflow_api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

###

### Get task by id
GET {{Taskflow_api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Update task
PUT {{Taskflow_api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Build TaskFlow project",
  "description": "Backend completed. Now build the React dashboard.",
  "status": "In Progress",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-13T18:00:00",
  "priority": "High"
}

###

### Delete task
DELETE {{Taskflow_api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1